Here is the method I'm referring to, in WebSocketServer.java:

``` java
        public void run() {
            WebSocketImpl ws = null;
            try {
                while ( true ) {
                    ByteBuffer buf = null;
                    ws = iqueue.take();
                    buf = ws.inQueue.poll();
                    assert ( buf != null );
                    try {
                        ws.decode( buf );
                    } finally {
                        pushBuffer( buf );
                    }
                }
            } catch ( InterruptedException e ) {
            } catch ( RuntimeException e ) {
                handleFatal( ws, e );
            }
        }
